00:23:09,060 --> 00:23:14,480
but despite Dixon's progress, he continued to delay commercial release of the kinetoscope.

312
00:23:16,300 --> 00:23:19,520
Without sound, he wasn't satisfied.

313
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:25,840
It took others in his company to push the silent kinetoscope into the marketplace.

314
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:39,560
In 1894, a group of outside investors bought 25 kinetoscopes and set up shop with 10 machines at 1155 Broadway, New York City.

315
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:45,920
Edison made sure he got hefty royalties from their efforts.

316
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:50,140
The first movie premiere was a movie premiere was a lot of the movie.

317
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:55,980
April 14th, 1894. The kinetoscope was an instant sensation.

318
00:23:55,981 --> 00:24:00,320
Soon, kinetoscope parlors were all the rage.

319
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:07,600
An early special event was a boxing match between former champ gentleman Jim Corbett and a punching

