00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:27,080
and they'd write headlines like World's Smartest Man meets World's Strongest Man.

338
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:32,460
Everybody had a good time, and the lab staff got free passes to Broadway shows.

339
00:25:34,020 --> 00:25:36,720
As simple as the early movies were,

340
00:25:36,820 --> 00:25:40,020
the power of the new medium quickly made itself known,

