00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:54,180
had a major impact on American culture right from the start.

345
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:57,940
A lot of these films were of things that were really forbidden

346
00:25:57,941 --> 00:25:59,400
to be seen in the flesh.

347
00:26:00,520 --> 00:26:02,080
His motion pictures really from the outset

348
00:26:02,081 --> 00:26:05,360
sort of turned commercial popter culture on its ear.

349
00:26:05,520 --> 00:26:07,480
I mean, it was a very disruptive force,

350
00:26:07,481 --> 00:26:15,040
something that it would take over a decade for the sort of the guardians of culture to recover from.

351
00:26:16,280 --> 00:26:20,660
By 1895, kinetoscope audiences were increasing.

352
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:25,900
But Edison's partner, Dixon, wanted to take the invention one step further

353
00:26:25,901 --> 00:26:28,600
