354
00:26:30,600 --> 00:26:33,000
Edison vehemently disagreed.

355
00:26:33,700 --> 00:26:36,160
Why kill the goose that lays the golden egg?

356
00:26:36,161 --> 00:26:37,240
He insisted.

357
00:26:38,460 --> 00:26:42,780
If he felt that you were infringing upon him in any way,

358
00:26:42,980 --> 00:26:44,160
questioning his authority,

359
00:26:45,100 --> 00:26:48,780
questioning his integrity or his imagination,

360
00:26:49,800 --> 00:26:53,640
differing with the direction that he thought should be taken in a given project,

