00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:13,940
Whatever Edison thought, ambitious entrepreneurs weren't waiting for the wizard to come up with a projecting kinetoscope.

364
00:27:15,260 --> 00:27:26,740
Frustrated with lab managers and eager to innovate, WKL Dixon started working on a projection system of his own, in secret, with someone else.

