00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:41,420
Most of his early motion pictures would have been considered illicit and immoral if projected.

367
00:27:47,780 --> 00:27:53,960
In 1895, frustrated with his boss's refusal to develop a projection system,

368
00:27:54,600 --> 00:28:00,520
Edison project manager WKL Dixon had begun working with Edison competitors.

369
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:06,140
When his activities were discovered, he was forced.

