00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:13,440
Dixon's bulky apparatus, the cinematograph's elegantly designed camera projector also reduced

382
00:29:13,441 --> 00:29:22,240
Edison's 46 frames per second speed to 16 frames for quieter, less jittery projection.

383
00:29:22,241 --> 00:29:30,860
Also, rather than using bulky electric power, the Lumiere camera was hand-cranked, ready to go anywhere.

384
00:29:30,861 --> 00:29:34,680
This is one of the early Lumier films.

385
00:29:34,681 --> 00:29:37,380
They were first projected on a large screen

386
00:29:37,381 --> 00:29:41,520
