00:31:08,681 --> 00:31:18,680
The most impressive short film was of surf crashing onto the shore at Dover.

414
00:31:18,681 --> 00:31:25,680
And this was a film loop that was repeated over and over again, and a number of people in the audience so struck by the realism of this

