00:33:26,681 --> 00:33:34,020
Early motion picture audiences were whisked around the world and across the country.

448
00:33:37,760 --> 00:33:41,220
Vanishing people and places were captured forever.

449
00:33:42,820 --> 00:33:46,340
Perceptions of time and distance had begun to shrink.

450
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:52,560
It didn't take long for the power and influence of the movies to be appreciated.

